    "summary": "The daemon installs a diagnostic at start-up (src/daemon/store-file-open-diagnostic.ts) that wraps fs/fs.promises open-by-path functions, re-syncs the built-in exports, and logs at warn the stack of any open of the live store's data or lock file, once per distinct stack. The file tools refuse those two files with LiveStoreFileRefusedError after resolving symbolic links: in the shared path helper, in copy and move (both paths, execute and approval gate), and in the search tools' roots; grep's walk skips them and a copied directory leaves them behind. The real daemon entry was started and stopped in a temporary home with no diagnostic warning at boot.",
